<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss 3-month money market claims yield 1.282 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss 3-month money market claims yield 1.282 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annual yield on the latest issue of Swiss federal government three-month money market claims is 1.282 percent, up from the previous issue's 1.194 percent, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The latest issue, to be paid for on July 3, raised 736.6 million Swiss francs and was priced at 99.677 percent.</p>
<p>The previous issue, paid for on June 26, raised 812.70 million and was priced at 99.699 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 6321 7340</p>
</text>
